### MCP > Control tool exposure

Source: https://pi.dev/docs/latest/mcp
Library: /local/pi/0.99.2

MCP servers using codemode exposure discover tools lazily.

Use `exposure: codemode` to enable this behavior.

---

### Pi settings

Source: https://pi.dev/docs/latest/settings
Library: /local/pi/0.99.2

Configure enabled tools in settings.

```json
{"enabled": true}
```

---

